    "description": "按条件数组过滤 JSON 记录集，支持多条件 AND/OR 组合。操作符：eq, ne, gt, gte, lt, lte, in, not_in, contains, not_contains, starts_with, ends_with, is_null, is_not_null, regex。返回满足条件的记录数组及条数。",
